      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The search for meaning is what makes us infinitely more than just a fleeting sound, so there is still value in creating it even if it is temporary. Many people find profound purpose in the very act of loving, laughing, and experiencing life, which proves that meaning is subjective rather than universal. Sometimes this perspective only serves as a temporary shadow, and the warmth of a meaningful moment might simply be worth fighting to preserve.",
